{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360230","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1036023001:1":{"text":"네, 한참 지켜봤는데, 한 마리도 안 보여요.","source_cn":"是的，我已经看了半天，里面一条鱼都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F43901497EBFF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036023002:1":{"text":"지나치게 맑은 물에는 물고기가 안 산다고 하던데, 이 연못은 그렇게 맑지도 않은데 왜... 설마 부패 때문에 수질에 이상이 생긴 걸까요?","source_cn":"都说特别清澈的水里才没有鱼，这水潭也不是很清澈……难道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BDB92AB6D4A4CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036023003:1":{"text":"에휴... 생선 먹고 싶은데!","source_cn":"唉……我好想吃鱼啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B70BBEB4438470","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民诺尔贝奇":{"text":"노르베치","source":"村民诺尔贝奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}